{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c7uGRc0qONRd46ST-8h7SQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.947313+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c7uGRc0qONRd46ST-8h7SQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><p><span>华东师范大学中国创意写作研究院成立于2018年10月30日，旨在接续华东师范大学几十年来悠久的“华东师大作家群”传统，推进文学教育与写作教育的发展，为社会培养一批文化素质突出、创作能力出色的青年写作人才。2027年招收创意写作和文稿写作两个方向的专业硕士。</span></p><p><span><span>创意写作</span>专业方向培养掌握文学领域相关知识、有突出的写作能力、适合文化事业与文化产业发展的创意写作人才。我系创意写作专业是全国首家隶属于文学类的专业硕士学位授权点，也是学校第一个以实践成果答辩授予硕士学位的专业学位类别，相关培养模式改革获得央视等权威媒体报道。</span></p><p><span><span>文稿写作</span>专业方向打破专业限制（欢迎中文专业或其他学科人才跨专业报名），拓展写作空间，在人才养成机制上守正创新，对接党政机关、企事业单位的专业写作需求，致力于培养政治理论扎实、基础知识广博、写作能力精湛的高素质青年政务人才。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>01</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法、品德良好；</span></p><p><span>2. 已获得或预计获得就读学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>3. 学习成绩优异，具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质和专业基础；</span></p><p><span>4. 诚实守信，学风端正，无任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></p><p><span>5. 身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>02</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名流程</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）时间及方式</span></p><p><span>有意申请的考生即日起可登录华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统</span><span>（</span><span>https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5,</span><span>以下简称报名系统）</span><span>注册账号，并于2026年9月3日23：00前填写并提交申请志愿。</span></p><p><span>每位考生最多可注册两个账号，填报两条独立志愿。在我系规定报名截止时间（2026年9月3日23：00）前，考生可自行取消提交状态、修改完善后再次提交。</span></p><p><span>（二）报名材料</span></p><p><span>1. 有效居民身份证；</span></p><p><span>2. 教育部学籍在线验证报告；</span></p><p><span>3. 预报名申请表（报名系统填写完毕后下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></p><p><span>4. 诚信承诺书（报名系统下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></p><p><span>5. 其他材料：包括本科学习成绩单、外语能力证明、获奖证书及其他能反映研究能力和创新潜质的材料，请合并为一个PDF文件上传，文件大小不超过10MB。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>03</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>其他说明</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 考生须保证提交材料真实、准确，不得弄虚作假，不得有学术不端行为。</span></p><p><span>2. 考生须密切关注报名系统中的审核状态及院系复试通知等信息。我系将在院系研究生招生工作小组的领导下成立材料审核专家组，对申请材料进行审核并确认是否接受申请，并根据上级部门和学校政策规范组织复试考核工作。</span></p><p><span>3. 报名系统中展示的学科专业及研究方向仅供参考，我校2027年推免专业目录最终以全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统公布为准。</span></p><p><span>4. 除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读我系2027年研究生的考生均须在正式取得推免资格后，在推免服务系统履行填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等正式程序。推免服务系统正式开放时间请及时关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></p><p><span>5. 错过预报名的考生如仍有意愿报考我系，可在推免服务系统开通后直接报名。我系将结合实际，确定是否再次组织推免复试考核与录取。</span></p><p><span>6. 若上级部门对推免招生工作有新的要求，我系将遵照执行。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>04</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>创意写作专业联系人：叶老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：021-54344874</span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：yeyangleaf@qq.com</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>文稿写作专业联系人：吴老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：021-54345081</span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：happyhan1987@163.com</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（院系暑假轮休时间，建议优先通过电子邮件方式咨询）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>欢迎广大学子报考华东师范大学创意写作与文稿写作专业！</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>华东师范大学中国创意写作研究院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年8月</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ddab8eae9813a235461fbf6c323479daf15eec75015b47ea395fac84302732ad","textLength":1480,"sourceSha256":"916bcf5a92ae7bc6784c3e51b1a88f09a5fdae91671a233f75af4eb72058f0a9","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d78c45fec711323f1f57","title":"2026年华东师范大学中国创意写作研究院2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.947313+00:00"}
